        "thread_id": "TH3",
        "thread_goal": "Set up calendar, communication plan, and training session logistics.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M28",
            "speaker_id": 425046,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi all, I've completed the initial setup for the Centralised Calendar (A4) for T4. My proposal is: blue for client visits, green for wellbeing activities. For access, I've set it so that assistants have edit rights, and all others have view-only to prevent accidental changes. What do you think?",
